@BNP_Usecase1_HostAddress = http://localhost:42688

### PaymentController

### Test producer: puts records on the Kafka topic (Kafka must be running). Returns 202 Accepted.
POST {{BNP_Usecase1_HostAddress}}/api/payment/publish
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "sourceSystem": "SYS1", "accountNumber": 1001, "pnLAmount": 2500 },
  { "sourceSystem": "SYS2", "accountNumber": 2002, "pnLAmount": 0 }
]

### Same call with an empty list. Returns 400 Bad Request.
POST {{BNP_Usecase1_HostAddress}}/api/payment/publish
Content-Type: application/json

[]

### PnL report: valid records
GET {{BNP_Usecase1_HostAddress}}/api/payment/valid
Accept: application/json

### PnL report: invalid records (PnL amount 0)
GET {{BNP_Usecase1_HostAddress}}/api/payment/invalid
Accept: application/json

### Unknown status. Returns 400 Bad Request.
GET {{BNP_Usecase1_HostAddress}}/api/payment/unknown
Accept: application/json

### All records
GET {{BNP_Usecase1_HostAddress}}/api/payment
Accept: application/json

###
